[Prior Planck] arrancando (50w × 10000s)...
  H₀ = 67.526 +0.352/-0.351  | MAP=67.528  ln P_MAP=-5.47  | accept=0.716  | 353.3s

[Prior MIRA] arrancando (50w × 10000s)...
  H₀ = 67.411 +0.350/-0.352  | MAP=67.409  ln P_MAP=-5.71  | accept=0.715  | 354.0s

[Prior SSEE] arrancando (50w × 10000s)...
